From 724428dc0bf4b629a239bf03e749dadcd67e5199 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeheartgold-3ds-bootstrap <bootstrap@invalid>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:57:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WiFi Plaza news: drop static where the internal header
 declares the helper

wifi_plaza_internal.h declares the 33 WiFiPlazaNewsSlots_*,
WiFiPlazaNewsEventList_* and WiFiPlazaNewsEvent_* helpers without static, but
src/wifi_plaza/wifi_plaza_news.c repeats them as static forward declarations
(:25-57) and definitions. GCC rejects each with "static declaration ... follows
non-static declaration" (33 errors); MWCC kept the file-scope symbols local
and accepted the mismatch. Same fix as 1512: a file-scope macro expands to
nothing under SDK_PORT_3DS so the definitions match the header, and to static
on the DS so the original text and linkage are unchanged.

gcc-10 -E -P without SDK_PORT_3DS: byte-identical (425681 bytes both).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/wifi_plaza/wifi_plaza_news.c | 141 ++++++++++++++++---------------
 1 file changed, 75 insertions(+), 66 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/wifi_plaza/wifi_plaza_news.c b/src/wifi_plaza/wifi_plaza_news.c
index cab7ea0..cfaf1bc 100644
